OL,3,GNEWSAMosque extension plan at former
OL,4,Arugby club refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to expand a mosque in a former
OL,7,Frugby club pavilion have been refused.
OL,9,FThe former Old Aylestonians Rugby
OL,10,FFootball Club pavilion in Knighton Lane
OL,11,FEast, Leicester, has been used by the
OL,12,FMasjid-Us Sunnah since Leicester City
OL,13,FCouncil planners approved a change of
OL,14,Fuse in October 2025.
OL,16,FApplicant Dr Louay Al-Alousi, imam at
OL,17,Fthe mosque, had sought permission to
OL,18,Fextend and alter the building to create
OL,19,Fa one-and-a-half storey place of
OL,20,Fworship, stating there had been
OL,21,Fincreasing demand.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
