OL,3,GNEWSAMosque extension plan at former
OL,4,Arugby club refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, planning officers refused the
OL,7,Fbid, saying the proposals were
OL,8,F"unacceptably squat and bulky" and
OL,9,Fcould cause traffic issues.
